### Movie Night API: example requests
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
### Run them top to bottom: signup/login fill @token automatically.

@api = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health
GET {{api}}/health

### ---------- Auth (public) ----------

### Sign up -> 201 { token, user }   (400 bad input, 409 email taken)
# @name signup
POST {{api}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@uni.edu", "password": "hunter22!", "displayName": "Alice" }

### Log in -> 200 { token, user }   (401 "Invalid email or password")
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@uni.edu", "password": "hunter22!" }

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Who am I -> 200 { user }   (401 without a token)
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Movies (public, proxied to TMDB) ----------

### Search -> 200 { page, totalPages, results: [...] }   (400 no query)
GET {{api}}/movies/search?query=inception&page=1

### Details incl. runtime -> 200   (404 unknown id)
GET {{api}}/movies/27205

### ---------- Nights (protected) ----------

### No token -> 401 { "error": "Missing token" }
GET {{api}}/nights

### Create a night -> 201 (joinCode generated by the server)
# @name night
POST {{api}}/nights
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Friday film club", "maxRuntimeMin": 150 }

@nightId = {{night.response.body._id}}
@joinCode = {{night.response.body.joinCode}}

### My nights (history) -> 200 [...]   optional ?status=open|closed
GET {{api}}/nights?status=open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Join with a code -> 201 (200 if already in)   (404 bad code, 400 closed night)
POST {{api}}/memberships
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "joinCode": "{{joinCode}}" }

### One night with members, suggestions, my ballot -> 200   (404 not a member)
GET {{api}}/nights/{{nightId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Edit (owner only) -> 200   (400 bad field, 403 not owner)
PATCH {{api}}/nights/{{nightId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Friday film club (pizza)" }

### ---------- Suggestions ----------

### Suggest a film by TMDB id -> 201   (409 already suggested, 404 unknown film)
# @name suggestion
POST {{api}}/nights/{{nightId}}/suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tmdbId": 27205 }

@suggestionId = {{suggestion.response.body._id}}

### Another one
POST {{api}}/nights/{{nightId}}/suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tmdbId": 603 }

### ---------- Voting ----------

### Save my ballot (replaces it) -> 200
### ranking: up to 3 suggestion ids, best first. veto: one id or null.
PUT {{api}}/nights/{{nightId}}/ballot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ranking": ["{{suggestionId}}"], "veto": null }

### My ballot -> 200
GET {{api}}/nights/{{nightId}}/ballot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Result: winner, runners-up, and why each film lost -> 200
GET {{api}}/nights/{{nightId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Close voting (owner only) -> 200
PATCH {{api}}/nights/{{nightId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "closed" }

### ---------- Deleting ----------

### Remove a suggestion (yours, or any if you own the night) -> 204
DELETE {{api}}/nights/{{nightId}}/suggestions/{{suggestionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete the night and everything in it (owner only) -> 204
DELETE {{api}}/nights/{{nightId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Watchlist (personal) ----------

### My watchlist, newest first -> 200
GET {{api}}/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save a movie (details come from TMDB) -> 201 (409 if already saved)
POST {{api}}/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tmdbId": 603 }

### Mark it as watched (or false for not watched) -> 200
PATCH {{api}}/watchlist/603
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "watched": true }

### Remove it from my watchlist -> 204
DELETE {{api}}/watchlist/603
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}